# The mana ring (`apps/ui/src/play/live/ManaRing.tsx`): alice's own Main 1 with a mana source of
# each kind the ring answers differently (probed in real Forge on a claw, runs 42132000056 and 42137472274):
#   Tundra          two abilities (getAbilityToPlay)
#   City of Brass   one ability; the colour is getChoices of five; 1 damage
#   Adarkar Wastes  {C} | W-or-U; W-or-U is Forge's two-button yes/no; 1 damage
# Nothing in hand: every tap only adds to the pool.
turn=1
